<title>USA: Commerce Dept delays Dec new-home sales to Feb 4.</title>
<headline>Commerce Dept delays Dec new-home sales to Feb 4.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commerce Department said Friday its monthly report on new-home sales for December was delayed to February 4 because of a processing error in a file.</p>
<p>&quot;The Census Bureau has found that it misprocessed a file. This discovery was made in final review,&quot; the department said.</p>
<p>The report had been slated for release at 1000 EST (1500 GMT) today. The department said it expected to release the report on Tuesday, February 4.</p>
